### Smell-Free Pattern ✅

`ValidateOrder_NullOrder_ThrowsArgumentNullException` (lines 155–163) is well-written: single method under test, uses `Assert.ThrowsException<T>`, asserts on the exception property. This is the pattern every test in this file should aspire to.

