### Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Fix Effort | Why First |
|----------|-------|-----------|-----------|
| 1 | **Assertion-Free Test** | Low | Actively hiding bugs — false pass |
| 2 | **Conditional Test Logic** | Low | One branch is untested right now |
| 3 | **Sleepy Test** | Medium | Flaky failures + suite slowdown |
| 4 | **Mystery Guest** | Low | Breaks in CI / cross-platform |
| 5 | **Exception Handling** | Low | Quick swap to `Assert.ThrowsException` |
| 6 | **Magic Number + Assertion Roulette** | Low | Same test, fix together |
| 7 | **Sensitive Equality** | Medium | Needs summary type to expose properties |
| 8 | **Eager Test** | Medium | Requires test decomposition or tag |
| 9 | **General Fixture** | Low | Remove field or add logging tests |

Items 1–2 and 5–6 are quick wins you can knock out in under 30 minutes. Items 3 and 7–8 require slightly more design work.
